- Huh ?

1042
01:03:24,300 --> 01:03:26,860
[ Grunting ]
You little brats !

1043
01:03:26,930 --> 01:03:29,560
Now !

1044
01:03:29,640 --> 01:03:33,070
- Intruders !
- [ Shouting ]

1045
