Uh, Fenwick,
why is the power off?

1055
01:04:37,100 --> 01:04:39,070
Uh, perhaps
we blew a fuse, sir ?

1056
01:04:39,140 --> 01:04:41,110
Well, go fix it !

1057
01:04:41,170 --> 01:04:44,730
